@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary contract: GET without a request body returns 200 OK and a JSON array
### with only severity and count fields. All enum levels are returned in the explicit
### declared enum order (Low, Medium, High, Critical), including zero-count levels.
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary with optional status filter (allowlist): Low 0, Medium 1, High 0, Critical 0
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary, no incidents match: 200, all counts 0
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary, invalid status: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Numeric status is not on the allowlist: expected 400 (before the fix it returned 200)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=1
Accept: application/json

### Unknown API route: expected 404 application/problem+json (before the fix: 200 text/html)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/abc
Accept: application/json
